OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation after woman's
OL,4,Abody found
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched after a woman was found dead
OL,8,Fat a property in Norfolk.
OL,10,FPolice said they found the body of a
OL,11,Fwoman in her 40s at an address in Fern
OL,12,FHill, Dersingham, on Sunday, after they
OL,13,Fwere called by the ambulance service
OL,14,Fshortly after 02:20 BST.
OL,16,FA man in his 40s was arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of murder and taken to King's
OL,18,FLynn Police Investigation Centre. He
OL,19,Fremains in custody.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
